SV PALACE WEBSITE
==================
Files:
- index.html — complete website
- style.css — responsive luxury gold/white design
- script.js — navigation, booking enquiry and WhatsApp

IMPORTANT BEFORE PUBLISHING:
1. Replace +91 99999 99999 and 919999999999 in index.html/script.js with the hotel's real number.
2. Replace the address if needed.
3. Replace the Unsplash image URLs with your own hotel/restaurant photos for a fully branded site.
4. Upload all three files to any static web host. No server/database is required for the current enquiry form.
